meta {
  name: Button press
  type: http
  seq: 14
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/btn?b=1&e=S
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Gestures are named <button><S|L>:

    1S / 1L   button 1 (left)   short / long
    2S / 2L   button 2 (right)  short / long
    3S / 3L   button 3          short / long

  The query takes the two halves, so `?b=1&e=S` is 1S and `?b=1&e=L` is 1L.
  Writes are POST-only on the portal; a GET silently no-ops.

  Legacy dialect still answers (b=L|R, e=R|RR) because older runs and
  tools/race.sh speak it, but new scripts should use b=1|2|3 with e=S|L.
}
